        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mughuusheanda ASEETA",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 5:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Geamuschi gweargwa mida ng'eang'deang'wa, eara aniini geawooschi gweargweeda geawuurjeeweegwa, ak geawooschi muuwshoocheanda sawanadeeda Gristo, ak geendeayeesi giigheambiita jea iidu eataajiit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oahaaghwana mughuusheanda fuga ASEETA ghayi siiteaganeegwa, nea goomiineadaysi, nea meediing'seegwa, asina aba gidoogasiidi nea adoosinyi aba gideaba googasayi lapiyeeda baspaseega, asi asina nea goomajeekchi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nea adoowuurjeewi fuga ambaliischi aba heedeaba fugiga mida hiing'eadaydeang'wean gidabal ghoahuunyi gichea eegala aba mughuusheandida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea geataajiit Jeagiischoocheanda haw, gajanyasa shiipka giika mayghaghajaamiit bea giigheambiitean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwasunu eara agooga gheareemanga asisiina gweargwa mureeda. Ookweala geat, oogasean, nea gaba siisi sissa nuut mureeda, aba gideaba, “ASEETA iissa ghaheawa fuga ghwarjeeda, ak ghoadaw dagheerjeanduumeeda fuga eada geat ng'eanyi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi ayiina geat hiing'eadayda geatinda ASEETA hoauur, ak iihita damanda abeeda goodiing'neegwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.5.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghoatawji niny sawanaduutkeagwa sean, aba gideaba niny gwadeawiisa muuchi ng'asheegeagwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Andeawana gheadeenda nea ghoang'wearu. Aba gideaba weajoocheandeang'wa was meang'nyeandeenda gawuurji ng'adiida ak gwanyeara daghata, nea gwaneay gagasa siida jea ghwanukghuta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghoaheawi niny, awasa majeek aba masaweega, nea ghoanali gideaba sawanadeeda ghwanyas fuga ghaheanya mida muunda ng'eanyiida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.5.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea ghang'ata sawanadeedida gilimwanang', hean ASEETA mideawa dagheerjeanduumeeda sean, ghayi guurneegwa apkaani jeeda giigheambiitaanyi manda muudeanooda aba jeeda Gristo, gaygoodeelu niny, ak goomajeegiideegwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.5.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Headaanyi gagasa gwanda gheambalmeeda damanda manda muudeanooda. Amin.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.5.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Giighacheeka huuydean",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Geang'oorneegwa barawajeanji nea ghaweadan Silwano, niny ghaadaayi orjeediyya doabiiwaat gil, ak geang'ayiichi ng'asheesu bea reekusiindean nea gearugu gideaba nih dagheerjeanduumeeda huumwa gil bea ASEETA; amiinaada aba badaydeaba nih nea goowooschi majeekcheewi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ganiiseeda mida Babeli, ghayi siloat eara ninyiin, ghoaghadeagwa; ak gwasunu eara orjeedeanyu was Marko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.5.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ookata geat nea goosamayi geat aba bariinyeega.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.5.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gagasa anyasa hoyyoo oogasean mida jeeda Gristohiin.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.5.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
